      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS... are delighted to present Apt 101 College View to the first time buyer or investment market. A superbly appointed two bedroom 2 bathroom third floor apartment that is sure to appeal to all those who cross its threshold. The apartment boasts bright and generous proportions throughout and the interior photos will be added over the coming days. This was an investment property so will require a little modernisation for the new owners. The bedrooms are spacious and the master bedroom has a large ensuite bedroom. \r\n\r\nExtending to approx. 60 sq.m./ 646 sq.ft, the accommodation comprises of an inviting hallway, two double bedrooms, master bedroom Ensuite, a large family bathroom, storage press, a generous living/dining room with balcony and a well designed kitchen area. Parking is by way of one designated car parking space underground.\r\n\r\nCollege View is an excellent mature development located on the main thoroughfare of the Ballymun town centre, which offers access to the swimming pool, Civic theatre, shopping area, Leisure Centre, Science and Technology Park. The DCU Campus is within 5 minutes walking distance and adjacent to M50, M1, Dublin Airport, Ikea and a wealth of local social & sporting amenities. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful property has to offer and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-8844690"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\n3.35m x 2.37m\r\n\r\nKitchen Area\r\n3.00m x 2.09m\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Area\r\n4.17m x 4.03m\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom\r\n5.03m x 2.54m\r\n\r\nEn-Suite\r\n1.71m x 1.49m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n3.58m x 2.14m\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.06m x 1.70m\r\n\r\n** Overall area approx. 60 sq mtrs **\r\n**Please note all measurements and floor plans are approximate and provided for guidance only**\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to ourselves. While every care is taken in preparing particulars the firm do not hold themselves responsible for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get a professional opinion on any concern they may have."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "* 2 bedroom 2 bathroom  third floor apartment spanning approx. 60 sq.mtrs / 646 sq.ft\r\n* Spacious accommodation throughout\r\n* A wonderful blank canvas awaits as modernisation is required\r\n* Balcony area - flooded with natural light and north facing \r\n* Minutes from DCU campus \r\n* Management Fee approx. €2,736.00 per annum \r\n* 15 minutes from Dublin Airport\r\n* Located minutes from the M50, IKEA, and close to the city centre and OMNI Shopping Centre"
